.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ifg-pr 1  "ifg-pr 0.9.0" 
.SH NAME
ifg\-pr \- Work with pull requests (`checkout` fetches the head branch)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg pr\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Work with pull requests (`checkout` fetches the head branch)
.PP
`ifg pr create` defaults `\-\-head` to the current branch and refuses to open a PR whose commits are not pushed yet. `checkout` fetches the PR head — from the fork when the PR came from one — into a local branch named `pr\-<number>`; running it again fast\-forwards that branch, and it falls back to the server\*(Aqs `refs/pull/<n>/head` mirror when the head branch has been deleted.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ifg\-pr\-list(1)
List pull requests
.TP
ifg\-pr\-view(1)
Show one pull request
.TP
ifg\-pr\-diff(1)
Print the diff of a pull request
.TP
ifg\-pr\-create(1)
Create a pull request (head defaults to the current branch)
.TP
ifg\-pr\-edit(1)
Update the PR title, body or draft state
.TP
ifg\-pr\-close(1)
Close an open PR
.TP
ifg\-pr\-reopen(1)
Reopen a closed PR
.TP
ifg\-pr\-comment(1)
Add a general review comment to a PR
.TP
ifg\-pr\-reviews(1)
List PR reviews and their general comments
.TP
ifg\-pr\-reviewers(1)
Manage requested reviewers
.TP
ifg\-pr\-merge(1)
Merge a pull request
.TP
ifg\-pr\-review(1)
Review a pull request
.TP
ifg\-pr\-checkout(1)
Fetch the PR head branch and check it out as pr\-<number>
.TP
ifg\-pr\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.9.0
